SkillSwap database migrations

See the root README.md section "Database migrations and administrator setup"
for new-database setup, existing-database adoption, backup requirements, and
safe operational commands.

The initial revision creates the baseline schema and built-in skill catalog;
the following revision updates review/report foreign keys without deleting
rows. The initial downgrade is intentionally disabled to prevent accidental
deletion of user data. Never run migrations automatically from application
workers.
